{"id":"torrey:warfare-of-saints","source":"torrey","name":"Warfare Of Saints","slug":"warfare-of-saints","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is not after the flesh — 2Co 10:3.","refs":[["2Cor",10,3,10,3]]},{"text":"Is a good warfare — 1Ti 1:18,19.","refs":[["1Tim",1,18,1,18],["1Tim",1,19,1,19]]},{"text":"Called the good fight of faith — 1Ti 6:12.","refs":[["1Tim",6,12,6,12]]},{"text":"The devil. — Ge 3:15; 2Co 2:11; Eph 6:12; Jas 4:7; 1Pe 5:8; Re 12:17.","refs":[["Gen",3,15,3,15],["2Cor",2,11,2,11],["Eph",6,12,6,12],["Jas",4,7,4,7],["1Pet",5,8,5,8],["Rev",12,17,12,17]]},{"text":"The flesh. — Ro 7:23; 1Co 9:25-27; 2Co 12:7; Ga 5:17; 1Pe 2:11.","refs":[["Rom",7,23,7,23],["1Cor",9,25,9,27],["2Cor",12,7,12,7],["Gal",5,17,5,17],["1Pet",2,11,2,11]]},{"text":"Enemies. — Ps 38:19; 56:2; 59:3.","refs":[["Ps",38,19,38,19],["Ps",56,2,56,2],["Ps",59,3,59,3]]},{"text":"The world. — Joh 16:33; 1Jo 5:4,5.","refs":[["John",16,33,16,33],["1John",5,4,5,4],["1John",5,5,5,5]]},{"text":"Death. — 1Co 15:26; Heb 2:14,15.","refs":[["1Cor",15,26,15,26],["Heb",2,14,2,14],["Heb",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Often arises from the opposition of friends or relatives — Mic 7:6; Mt 10:35,36.","refs":[["Mic",7,6,7,6],["Matt",10,35,10,35],["Matt",10,36,10,36]]},{"text":"Under Christ, as our captain. — Heb 2:10.","refs":[["Heb",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"Under the Lord’s banner. — Ps 60:4.","refs":[["Ps",60,4,60,4]]},{"text":"With faith. — 1Ti 1:18,19.","refs":[["1Tim",1,18,1,18],["1Tim",1,19,1,19]]},{"text":"With a good conscience. — 1Ti 1:18,19.","refs":[["1Tim",1,18,1,18],["1Tim",1,19,1,19]]},{"text":"With steadfastness in the faith. — 1Co 16:13; 1Pe 5:9; Heb 10:23.","refs":[["1Cor",16,13,16,13],["1Pet",5,9,5,9],["Heb",10,23,10,23]]},{"text":"With earnestness. — Jude 1:3.","refs":[["Jude",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"With watchfulness. — 1Co 16:13; 1Pe 5:8.","refs":[["1Cor",16,13,16,13],["1Pet",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"With sobriety. — 1Th 5:6; 1Pe 5:8.","refs":[["1Thess",5,6,5,6],["1Pet",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"With endurance or hardness. — 2Ti 2:3,10.","refs":[["2Tim",2,3,2,3],["2Tim",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"With self-denial. — 1Co 9:25-27.","refs":[["1Cor",9,25,9,27]]},{"text":"With confidence in God. — Ps 27:1-3.","refs":[["Ps",27,1,27,3]]},{"text":"With prayer. — Ps 35:1-3; Eph 6:18.","refs":[["Ps",35,1,35,3],["Eph",6,18,6,18]]},{"text":"Without earthly entanglements. — 2Ti 2:4.","refs":[["2Tim",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Mere professors do not maintain — Jer 9:3.","refs":[["Jer",9,3,9,3]]},{"text":"Are all engaged in. — Php 1:30.","refs":[["Phil",1,30,1,30]]},{"text":"Must stand firm in. — Eph 6:13,14.","refs":[["Eph",6,13,6,13],["Eph",6,14,6,14]]},{"text":"Exhorted to diligence. — 1Ti 6:12; Jude 1:3.","refs":[["1Tim",6,12,6,12],["Jude",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"Encouraged in. — Isa 41:11,12; 51:12; Mic 7:8; 1Jo 4:4.","refs":[["Isa",41,11,41,11],["Isa",41,12,41,12],["Isa",51,12,51,12],["Mic",7,8,7,8],["1John",4,4,4,4]]},{"text":"Helped by God in. — Ps 118:13; Isa 41:13,14.","refs":[["Ps",118,13,118,13],["Isa",41,13,41,13],["Isa",41,14,41,14]]},{"text":"Protected by God in. — Ps 140:7.","refs":[["Ps",140,7,140,7]]},{"text":"Comforted by God in. — 2Co 7:5,6.","refs":[["2Cor",7,5,7,5],["2Cor",7,6,7,6]]},{"text":"Strengthened by God in. — Ps 20:2; 27:14; Isa 41:10.","refs":[["Ps",20,2,20,2],["Ps",27,14,27,14],["Isa",41,10,41,10]]},{"text":"Strengthened by Christ in. — 2Co 12:9; 2Ti 4:17.","refs":[["2Cor",12,9,12,9],["2Tim",4,17,4,17]]},{"text":"Delivered by Christ in. — 2Ti 4:18.","refs":[["2Tim",4,18,4,18]]},{"text":"Thank God for victory in. — Ro 7:25; 1Co 15:57.","refs":[["Rom",7,25,7,25],["1Cor",15,57,15,57]]},{"text":"Girdle of truth. — Eph 6:14.","refs":[["Eph",6,14,6,14]]},{"text":"Breastplate of righteousness. — Eph 6:14.","refs":[["Eph",6,14,6,14]]},{"text":"Preparation of the gospel. — Eph 6:15.","refs":[["Eph",6,15,6,15]]},{"text":"Shield of faith. — Eph 6:16.","refs":[["Eph",6,16,6,16]]},{"text":"Helmet of salvation. — Eph 6:17; 1Th 5:8.","refs":[["Eph",6,17,6,17],["1Thess",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"Sword of the Spirit. — Eph 6:17.","refs":[["Eph",6,17,6,17]]},{"text":"Called armour of God. — Eph 6:11.","refs":[["Eph",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"Called armour of righteousness. — 2Co 6:7.","refs":[["2Cor",6,7,6,7]]},{"text":"Called armour of light. — Ro 13:12.","refs":[["Rom",13,12,13,12]]},{"text":"Not carnal. — 2Co 10:4.","refs":[["2Cor",10,4,10,4]]},{"text":"Mighty through God. — 2Co 10:4,5.","refs":[["2Cor",10,4,10,4],["2Cor",10,5,10,5]]},{"text":"The whole, is required. — Eph 6:13.","refs":[["Eph",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"Must be put on. — Ro 13:12; Eph 6:11.","refs":[["Rom",13,12,13,12],["Eph",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"To be on right hand and left. — 2Co 6:7.","refs":[["2Cor",6,7,6,7]]},{"text":"From God. — 1Co 15:57; 2Co 2:14.","refs":[["1Cor",15,57,15,57],["2Cor",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Through Christ. — Ro 7:25; 1Co 15:27; 2Co 12:9; Re 12:11.","refs":[["Rom",7,25,7,25],["1Cor",15,27,15,27],["2Cor",12,9,12,9],["Rev",12,11,12,11]]},{"text":"By faith. — Heb 11:33-37; 1Jo 5:4,5.","refs":[["Heb",11,33,11,37],["1John",5,4,5,4],["1John",5,5,5,5]]},{"text":"Over the devil. — Ro 16:20; 1Jo 2:14.","refs":[["Rom",16,20,16,20],["1John",2,14,2,14]]},{"text":"Over the flesh. — Ro 7:24,25; Ga 5:24.","refs":[["Rom",7,24,7,24],["Rom",7,25,7,25],["Gal",5,24,5,24]]},{"text":"Over the world. — 1Jo 5:4,5.","refs":[["1John",5,4,5,4],["1John",5,5,5,5]]},{"text":"Over all that exalts itself. — 2Co 10:5.","refs":[["2Cor",10,5,10,5]]},{"text":"Over death and the grave. — Isa 25:8; 26:19; Ho 13:14; 1Co 15:54,55.","refs":[["Isa",25,8,25,8],["Isa",26,19,26,19],["Hos",13,14,13,14],["1Cor",15,54,15,54],["1Cor",15,55,15,55]]},{"text":"Triumphant. — Ro 8:37; 2Co 10:5.","refs":[["Rom",8,37,8,37],["2Cor",10,5,10,5]]},{"text":"Eat of the hidden manna. — Re 2:17.","refs":[["Rev",2,17,2,17]]},{"text":"Eat of the tree of life. — Re 2:7.","refs":[["Rev",2,7,2,7]]},{"text":"Be clothed in white raiment. — Re 3:5.","refs":[["Rev",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Be pillars in the temple of God. — Re 3:12.","refs":[["Rev",3,12,3,12]]},{"text":"Sit with Christ in his throne. — Re 3:21.","refs":[["Rev",3,21,3,21]]},{"text":"Have a white stone, and, in it a new name written. — Re 2:17.","refs":[["Rev",2,17,2,17]]},{"text":"Have power over the nations. — Re 2:26.","refs":[["Rev",2,26,2,26]]},{"text":"Have the name of God written upon them by Christ. — Re 3:12.","refs":[["Rev",3,12,3,12]]},{"text":"Have God as their God. — Re 21:7.","refs":[["Rev",21,7,21,7]]},{"text":"Have the morning-star. — Re 2:28.","refs":[["Rev",2,28,2,28]]},{"text":"Inherit all things. — Re 21:7.","refs":[["Rev",21,7,21,7]]},{"text":"Be confessed by Christ before God the Father. — Re 3:5.","refs":[["Rev",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Be sons of God. — Re 21:7.","refs":[["Rev",21,7,21,7]]},{"text":"Not be hurt by the second death. — Re 2:11.","refs":[["Rev",2,11,2,11]]},{"text":"Not have their names blotted out of the book of life. — Re 3:5.","refs":[["Rev",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Isa 9:5; Zec 10:5.","refs":[["Isa",9,5,9,5],["Zech",10,5,10,5]]}],"refCount":131}
